WEBVTT

00:07.674 --> 00:11.678
I never realized...

00:11.678 --> 00:15.671
On that day... The day
I met Zero and Ichii...

00:16.683 --> 00:20.687
On the day that they told me
they would protect me...

00:20.687 --> 00:25.358
...that one day the day would
come for us to say goodbye...

00:25.358 --> 00:29.696
I always thought we
would be together forever.

00:29.696 --> 00:34.034
I always believed that
they would protect me forever.

00:34.034 --> 00:38.038
But the parting is
right around the corner.

00:38.038 --> 00:43.376
I wonder what Zero and Ichii
are planning to do...

00:43.376 --> 00:49.042
Once the Crystal Pearl is removed
from my body and the test ends...

00:50.383 --> 00:54.376
I wonder what Zero and Ichii
are planning to do...

00:55.388 --> 00:58.558
The test is coming up very soon.

00:58.558 --> 01:00.549
Christmas...

01:01.094 --> 01:13.706
One love! Two love? Three love! Four love?
One love! Two love? Three love! Come on!

01:13.706 --> 01:19.979
Here's what boys don't know.
Girls are moody.

01:19.979 --> 01:26.219
You're a sweet person
and it will be okay tomorrow.

01:26.219 --> 01:32.525
But I feel different today.
I want to go all out!

01:32.525 --> 01:38.798
Because I can't decide it just yet
I want everything

01:38.798 --> 01:45.071
The kinds of love are just like jewels.

01:45.071 --> 01:51.344
Each of them (Shining boys!)
is sparkling. Yes!

01:51.344 --> 01:57.650
They say there is only one true love

01:57.650 --> 02:03.957
But it's okay, we can decide
that at the very last moment

02:03.957 --> 02:10.196
That moment (Happiness)
I will protect it (Happiness)

02:10.196 --> 02:16.503
Come on, let's go find a popping heart

02:16.503 --> 02:22.775
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!

02:22.775 --> 02:27.542
My love! True love! Your love!
Pure love! My love! True love!

02:31.484 --> 02:34.487
Wow, check it out! It's so cute!

02:34.487 --> 02:35.822
Zura!

02:35.822 --> 02:40.493
Look at that one! It has
a Santa Claus on it! Reindeer, too!

02:40.493 --> 02:43.163
Whoa! It looks delicious zura!

02:43.163 --> 02:45.665
No, you can't eat Santa Claus!

02:45.665 --> 02:48.501
What? I can't eat him zura?

02:48.501 --> 02:51.838
Of course not! That's a candle!

02:51.838 --> 02:53.506
Christmas, huh...

02:53.506 --> 02:54.841
Ichii?

02:54.841 --> 02:56.843
I just realized it's
right around the corner.

02:56.843 --> 02:58.511
Right.

02:58.511 --> 03:03.183
Seriously, time does fly, huh?
It's time for Christmas, huh?

03:03.183 --> 03:05.852
Hey, Zero, Ichii.

03:05.852 --> 03:07.187
For Christmas-

03:07.187 --> 03:07.854
- Huh?
- Huh?

03:07.854 --> 03:10.857
Oh, I changed my mind!
I should keep it a secret!

03:10.857 --> 03:13.526
Hey, what was that about, Nina?
Just say it!

03:13.526 --> 03:17.530
It's a secret! I changed my mind,
so I'm not going to tell you!

03:17.530 --> 03:18.531
Hey!

03:18.531 --> 03:22.869
Because it would be no fun
if I asked them,

03:22.869 --> 03:25.538
"What do you want for Christmas?"

03:25.538 --> 03:29.941
But I'd like to give something
to Zero and Ichii.

03:30.543 --> 03:32.010
Huh?

03:35.548 --> 03:40.220
O-Of course I'd give you something,
too, Zura! A nice gift!

03:40.220 --> 03:47.560
Because Zero, Ichii and Zura
are all important to me!

03:47.560 --> 03:50.552
They're my everlasting friends...

03:51.898 --> 03:53.066
That's right...

03:53.066 --> 03:59.572
At that time I was certain that
this happiness would last forever, but...

03:59.572 --> 04:02.408
The sorcery test is almost here.

04:02.408 --> 04:03.898
Christmas...

04:10.083 --> 04:13.753
I have no idea!
What am I supposed to do?

04:13.753 --> 04:15.421
How about Ichii?

04:15.421 --> 04:17.590
How about Zero?

04:17.590 --> 04:20.927
Geez, I wonder what
kind of stuff they like!

04:20.927 --> 04:23.263
I don't think hats are
all that trendy right now.

04:23.263 --> 04:26.266
There's really not enough
time to knit scarves...

04:26.266 --> 04:30.103
All right, how about giving Ichii
some accessories because he's mature?

04:30.103 --> 04:33.095
And for Zero... A vest?

04:35.608 --> 04:38.778
Wh-What, you two?
You guys are scaring me...

04:38.778 --> 04:40.780
I can feel the intensity
coming from you!

04:40.780 --> 04:43.116
- What do you expect, Nina?
- What do you expect, Nina?

04:43.116 --> 04:45.785
Because Christmas Eve
is coming up very soon!

04:45.785 --> 04:46.786
Eve?

04:46.786 --> 04:50.790
December 24th! Obviously we're talking
about the day before Christmas!!

04:50.790 --> 04:52.292
Yeah, I know that much, but...

04:52.292 --> 04:54.794
Nina, what are you planning to do?

04:54.794 --> 04:56.629
"What am I planning to do"?

04:56.629 --> 05:01.634
We're talking about Christmas Eve!
December 24th!

05:01.634 --> 05:06.306
Because that is the day you spend
with the person you love the most!

05:06.306 --> 05:09.309
A very important day that
comes around only once a year!

05:09.309 --> 05:12.812
So which one of them are you
planning to spend the day with, Nina?

05:12.812 --> 05:14.981
- With Zero-kun or with Ichii-kun?
- With Zero-kun or with Ichii-kun?

05:14.981 --> 05:16.141
- Which one?
- Which one?

05:16.316 --> 05:18.147
- Which one?
- Which one?

05:18.318 --> 05:19.319
- Which one?
- Which one?

05:19.319 --> 05:20.320
What?

05:20.320 --> 05:23.990
Which one are you going to
spend the day with, Nina? Huh?

05:23.990 --> 05:25.855
"Which one"?

05:33.333 --> 05:36.836
Nina-chan... So you've chosen me...

05:36.836 --> 05:39.339
Nina-chan! Nina-chan!!

05:39.339 --> 05:41.007
Nina-chan!

05:41.007 --> 05:43.676
Hold it right there!

05:43.676 --> 05:46.346
I won't let you have Nina!

05:46.346 --> 05:48.014
Don't give me that!

05:48.014 --> 05:50.016
Nina-chan is the person
that I love the most!

05:50.016 --> 05:51.351
What?

05:51.351 --> 05:52.352
Fight me!

05:52.352 --> 05:54.013
As you wish!

05:58.358 --> 06:00.360
Stop it! Stop it!

06:00.360 --> 06:03.363
It's all my fault!
I'm the one who's wrong!

06:03.363 --> 06:08.701
Stop it! I can't just pick one! I can't!

06:08.701 --> 06:12.372
No! Zero! Ichii!

06:12.372 --> 06:14.363
No!!

06:18.044 --> 06:19.379
Stop it! Stop it! Stop it!

06:19.379 --> 06:20.046
What?

06:20.046 --> 06:21.714
What are you doing, Nina?

06:21.714 --> 06:23.705
Huh? Oh, err...

06:25.718 --> 06:27.709
Nothing, nothing!

06:30.723 --> 06:33.726
After all I can't just pick one!

06:33.726 --> 06:40.900
I just want to spend Christmas Eve
with everyone. Zero, Ichii and Zura...

06:40.900 --> 06:45.405
The cake shop isn't this way zura!

06:45.405 --> 06:47.073
Nina.

06:47.073 --> 06:49.075
Aren't you going to the cake shop?

06:49.075 --> 06:51.077
What are you talking about?
Of course I'm going!

06:51.077 --> 06:52.412
Come on, let's go!

06:52.412 --> 06:54.914
What's up with her? I don't get it.

06:54.914 --> 06:57.583
That's just how girls' minds are.

06:57.583 --> 06:59.419
Sheesh!

06:59.419 --> 07:01.754
This is okay, isn't it?

07:01.754 --> 07:04.424
Even if I don't force myself
to pick one of them.

07:04.424 --> 07:09.429
I just want to be with everyone for now...
With Zero, Ichii and Zura...

07:09.429 --> 07:12.592
I want to spend
Christmas with everyone.

07:13.599 --> 07:16.769
But still, what should I give them?

07:16.769 --> 07:19.772
What could I give guys
to make them happy anyway?

07:19.772 --> 07:21.774
Geez, I'm totally clueless!

07:21.774 --> 07:23.443
Especially when they're sorcerers!

07:23.443 --> 07:26.112
What could they possibly want?

07:26.112 --> 07:29.115
All right! Why don't I go all-out and...

07:29.115 --> 07:31.106
Merry Christmas!!

07:32.452 --> 07:35.455
The gift for you is me, Nina!

07:35.455 --> 07:37.457
Yeah, sure...

07:37.457 --> 07:40.793
What would junior high school boys want?

07:40.793 --> 07:43.463
All right! Now it's come to this

07:43.463 --> 07:46.466
I should try to ask Zero and Ichii
very casually what they would want!

07:46.466 --> 07:49.635
I wonder if they're still up...
Zero and Ichii...

07:49.635 --> 07:51.304
Ichii-

07:51.304 --> 07:53.473
Hey, what are you going to do?

07:53.473 --> 07:56.142
"What am I going to do?"
You mean, about Christmas?

07:56.142 --> 08:00.146
Yeah, I want to give something
to Nina-chan, you know.

08:00.146 --> 08:03.138
Because this is going to be
our last Christmas together.

08:06.152 --> 08:10.490
Most likely, after the test
which's going to be hold on Christmas,

08:10.490 --> 08:12.158
we will no longer...

08:12.158 --> 08:17.497
...have to protect the
Crystal Pearl inside of Nina-chan.

08:17.497 --> 08:23.503
And when the time comes, I guess,
we will go back home, right?

08:23.503 --> 08:26.839
Yeah. Time flew by, huh?

08:26.839 --> 08:32.512
So Zero, why don't we give her
something before we go?

08:32.512 --> 08:33.513
At parting...

08:33.513 --> 08:36.516
What? Parting?

08:36.516 --> 08:39.051
Parting?

08:39.051 --> 08:42.855
I've never even thought about it.

08:42.855 --> 08:46.526
On that day... The day
I first met Zero and Ichii...

08:46.526 --> 08:49.529
I didn't even think that one day
the day for us to be apart would come...

08:49.529 --> 08:52.698
I thought that we'd always be together...

08:52.698 --> 08:56.369
I thought that
they'd always protect me...

08:56.369 --> 09:02.542
I had no idea the day for us
to be apart was right there...

09:02.542 --> 09:05.711
That's right, the two will
be gone after the test is over.

09:05.711 --> 09:07.547
Whether they pass it or not,

09:07.547 --> 09:10.550
they'll still go back
to the magical world.

09:10.550 --> 09:14.543
Leaving that lollipop with me...

09:17.223 --> 09:20.560
I wish there were no sorcery test!

09:20.560 --> 09:24.223
I wish there were no Christmas!

09:25.565 --> 09:29.433
The parting is right around
the corner... The sorcery test...

09:30.903 --> 09:33.072
The day of Christmas...

09:33.072 --> 09:34.403
Nina...

09:49.589 --> 09:53.923
Aw, it's gotten so late while I was
taking care of the council stuff!

09:55.595 --> 09:57.763
No one is here...

09:57.763 --> 10:00.933
I guess both Zero and Ichii
have already gone home.

10:00.933 --> 10:03.936
That's kind of mean
to go home without me.

10:03.936 --> 10:07.273
No big deal! I can go home
by myself just fine!

10:07.273 --> 10:10.003
I'll be fine without those two!

10:11.611 --> 10:15.615
But, now that I think about it
I haven't been alone for a while.

10:15.615 --> 10:19.118
Because Zero and Ichii
have been always with me,

10:19.118 --> 10:22.955
so there has been no time
for me to feel alone at all.

10:22.955 --> 10:27.293
But either way I'll be alone
after Christmas.

10:27.293 --> 10:30.963
Oh well, I guess I'll try
to get used to it early.

10:30.963 --> 10:33.299
The life where it's just me alone...

10:33.299 --> 10:34.288
Nina-chan.

10:35.301 --> 10:38.137
Thank you for your hard word
for the student council!

10:38.137 --> 10:41.641
You sure took forever, Nina! I was
getting tired of waiting for you!

10:41.641 --> 10:43.976
Let's hurry up and go to
the cake shop zura!

10:43.976 --> 10:46.312
I'm starving zura!

10:46.312 --> 10:48.648
Zero, Ichii-

10:48.648 --> 10:51.651
You two were waiting for me-

10:51.651 --> 10:54.320
But... But...

10:54.320 --> 10:56.489
Zero and Ichii will...

10:56.489 --> 11:00.152
...still be gone after Christmas...

11:02.328 --> 11:04.660
Nina! Nina!

11:05.998 --> 11:09.669
I'm sorry, but not today...

11:09.669 --> 11:15.007
I've already had an appointment with
Hatsuka and Yo-chan, so I'm sorry!

11:15.007 --> 11:17.009
Hey, Nina-chan!

11:17.009 --> 11:18.344
Nina!

11:18.344 --> 11:21.347
At any rate, we still have
to protect Nina-chan!

11:21.347 --> 11:22.348
Yeah!

11:22.348 --> 11:23.679
Let's go.

11:26.018 --> 11:28.688
Nina! Nina! Over here!

11:28.688 --> 11:31.357
Hatsuka, Yo-chan, thank you for waiting!

11:31.357 --> 11:33.693
Oh? Where're Zero-kun and Ichii-kun?

11:33.693 --> 11:35.027
I don't know.

11:35.027 --> 11:38.030
- What? Aren't you with them?
- What? Aren't you with them?

11:38.030 --> 11:40.700
It's not like I'm with
them all the time!

11:40.700 --> 11:44.036
- What? But you are always with them!
- What? But you are always with them!

11:44.036 --> 11:46.706
Come on, let's just eat some cakes.

11:46.706 --> 11:48.374
- Did you guys fight or something?
- Did you guys fight or something?

11:48.374 --> 11:49.705
No, not really.

11:51.043 --> 11:53.879
- Nina sure is acting strange...
- Nina sure is acting strange...

11:53.879 --> 11:55.047
- Yeah...
- Yeah...

11:55.047 --> 11:58.050
What's her deal? She told us
she didn't want to come here!

11:58.050 --> 12:00.720
It's not fair that
she's eating without us zura!

12:00.720 --> 12:02.711
Fine! We'll go too!

12:03.723 --> 12:07.727
What's up, Ichii?
Look, she's eating cakes without us!

12:07.727 --> 12:08.894
Don't do it.

12:08.894 --> 12:10.563
Why not?

12:10.563 --> 12:13.733
She might not want to do this anymore.

12:13.733 --> 12:15.901
She might not want to do what anymore?

12:15.901 --> 12:19.405
Be with us all the time!

12:19.405 --> 12:21.741
Ichii, what are you talking about
all of a sudden zura?

12:21.741 --> 12:26.412
But this is to protect the Crystal Pearl!
We have no choice!

12:26.412 --> 12:28.581
Until the sorcery test is over!

12:28.581 --> 12:33.085
But that's our selfish reasoning.

12:33.085 --> 12:36.088
Nina-chan is just
an ordinary human girl.

12:36.088 --> 12:40.092
Neither the Crystal Pearl
or the sorcery test concerns her!

12:40.092 --> 12:44.096
It was an accident that Nina-chan
swallowed the Crystal Pearl.

12:44.096 --> 12:46.766
We're the ones who forced her
to get caught up in this

12:46.766 --> 12:49.435
so we could pass the sorcery test.

12:49.435 --> 12:51.103
So if she said
she didn't want to do this,

12:51.103 --> 12:52.772
there'd be nothing we could do about it.

12:52.772 --> 12:54.774
I feel bad for Nina-chan,

12:54.774 --> 12:58.611
but we have to stick around
with her for just one more week.

12:58.611 --> 13:03.783
And after that there'll be no need
for us to be around Nina-chan.

13:03.783 --> 13:06.786
Bye! See you later!

13:06.786 --> 13:07.787
Yeah!

13:07.787 --> 13:09.789
Good luck to all of us with the homework!

13:09.789 --> 13:12.458
Wait, do we have homework?

13:12.458 --> 13:15.461
- Just kidding! No homework for us!
- Just kidding! No homework for us!

13:15.461 --> 13:17.797
- See you, Nina! Bye!
- See you, Nina! Bye!

13:17.797 --> 13:24.136
Hey, Hatsuka! Yo-chan! Geez,
I can't believe they just did that!

13:24.136 --> 13:28.808
Zero... Ichii... Have you guys been
waiting for me out here the whole time?

13:28.808 --> 13:34.814
Because- It'd be a problem if you get
attacked by other examinees, right?

13:34.814 --> 13:36.816
I'll be all right!

13:36.816 --> 13:37.817
Nina.

13:37.817 --> 13:40.486
We're sorry for keeping you
running around with us all this time.

13:40.486 --> 13:46.158
But there's only a week left, so please
be patient just a little longer, okay?

13:46.158 --> 13:49.662
After that we'll go
back to the magic world,

13:49.662 --> 13:52.832
so you won't be forced
to hang out with us anymore.

13:52.832 --> 13:56.168
Nina-chan, before we go,
as a token of appreciation for you,

13:56.168 --> 13:58.504
we'd like to give you some kind of gift.

13:58.504 --> 14:04.176
What would be good? Isn't there anything
you want, Nina? You can name anything.

14:04.176 --> 14:05.578
I don't want it.

14:05.578 --> 14:06.178
What?

14:06.178 --> 14:08.848
I said I don't want it!
I don't want anything!

14:08.848 --> 14:11.684
Why don't you just go home, you two?

14:11.684 --> 14:16.856
We'll never see each other again anyway,
so don't bother to leave me with memories!

14:16.856 --> 14:21.861
No... Zero... Ichii... I hate you!

14:21.861 --> 14:22.862
N-Nina-chan!

14:22.862 --> 14:23.863
Nina!

14:23.863 --> 14:28.197
"Don't bother to leave me
with memories" zura...

14:35.374 --> 14:38.377
Whatever! Whatever!

14:38.377 --> 14:40.713
You liar, Zero, Ichii!

14:40.713 --> 14:43.549
Zero, Ichii, you're so heartless!

14:43.549 --> 14:45.551
- This is for you, Nina-chan.
- A candy?

14:45.551 --> 14:50.723
A lollipop. It fits your image,
Nina-chan. You know, it's cute.

14:50.723 --> 14:52.892
C-Cute?

14:52.892 --> 14:54.553
After all that talk...

14:56.562 --> 15:02.234
I wish they never came here in the
first place if they had to go back.

15:02.234 --> 15:06.405
I just have too many
memories of those two...

15:06.405 --> 15:08.908
Zero! Ichii!

15:08.908 --> 15:15.581
If I became alone, I'd be lonely,
sad and suffering...

15:15.581 --> 15:18.250
I just wouldn't know what to do!

15:18.250 --> 15:20.582
Zero! Ichii!

15:21.587 --> 15:25.591
Nina, is this that painful to you zura?

15:25.591 --> 15:27.593
If this were that painful,
I wouldn't mind

15:27.593 --> 15:32.932
going to the magic world now
and acquire one magic for you zura.

15:32.932 --> 15:35.601
What? What kind of magic?

15:35.601 --> 15:39.271
The magic to erase your memories zura.

15:39.271 --> 15:42.942
If it's going to be so lonely,
sad and painful

15:42.942 --> 15:47.613
for you to think about Zero and Ichii
after those two are gone,

15:47.613 --> 15:52.284
I wouldn't mind going to get the magic
to erase your memories zura, you know.

15:52.284 --> 15:54.954
So with that, am I going
to forget about everything?

15:54.954 --> 15:58.290
I mean, about you, Zero and Ichii?

15:58.290 --> 15:59.625
That's right, zura.

15:59.625 --> 16:02.294
You'll forget about the day you first
met us, about the days we lived together,

16:02.294 --> 16:05.297
about how we ate those cakes,
about the time we went to the hot spring,

16:05.297 --> 16:08.300
about the summer beach and
about the time you guys switched...

16:08.300 --> 16:10.636
You'll forget it all zura.

16:10.636 --> 16:15.140
Both sad memories and fun memories
that all four of us created together,

16:15.140 --> 16:15.975
I mean everything!

16:15.975 --> 16:17.309
Everything?

16:17.309 --> 16:18.644
Everything...

16:18.644 --> 16:19.979
That's right zura...

16:19.979 --> 16:24.483
If that'd make you feel better, I wouldn't
mind going to get it for you zura...

16:24.483 --> 16:26.151
The magic...

16:26.151 --> 16:27.319
Zura...

16:27.319 --> 16:29.651
It's up to you to decide zura.

16:30.656 --> 16:32.324
So what are you going to do zura?

16:32.324 --> 16:36.662
The choice is yours zura, Nina.

16:36.662 --> 16:37.993
I'll-

16:38.998 --> 16:42.668
Hey, check it out, Nina-chan!

16:42.668 --> 16:47.339
Isn't it great? Look at this dress!

16:47.339 --> 16:49.675
It's a Christmas gift for Fo-chan!

16:49.675 --> 16:54.013
I'm going to give it to him once the test
is over! I bet Fo-chan will love it!

16:54.013 --> 16:57.349
Umm, I doubt it.

16:57.349 --> 17:02.354
It's a secret, so don't say anything
about it to Fo-chan until Christmas!

17:02.354 --> 17:04.023
See ya!

17:04.023 --> 17:08.027
But I don't think Forte will
be happy about that though.

17:08.027 --> 17:10.029
Whoa, move, move, move!

17:10.029 --> 17:11.030
I'm going to fall! I'm going to fall!
I'm going to fall!

17:11.030 --> 17:13.699
Somebody help me! Anybody please help me!

17:13.699 --> 17:16.031
At least get the boxes for me!

17:22.708 --> 17:24.043
Thank you!

17:24.043 --> 17:26.045
What's going on, Forte?

17:26.045 --> 17:28.714
I'm going to bake a
"Christmas cake" with these!

17:28.714 --> 17:30.382
- Cake?
- Cake?

17:30.382 --> 17:35.054
Because San told me she
wouldn't eat it unless I bake it!

17:35.054 --> 17:37.056
See you guys later! I have to go

17:37.056 --> 17:40.048
because I have a lot of stuff to do
like decorating the room and stuff!

17:41.060 --> 17:43.051
Even Fo-chan too?

17:44.063 --> 17:46.231
Huh? Hmm?

17:46.231 --> 17:50.235
Is that person over there Rokka?

17:50.235 --> 17:52.071
What is she doing?

17:52.071 --> 17:53.402
Excuse me.

17:56.742 --> 17:58.410
Y-You are-

17:58.410 --> 17:59.411
It's Gou.

17:59.411 --> 18:01.080
It's Gou.

18:01.080 --> 18:03.282
It's Gou.

18:03.282 --> 18:06.585
All right, so what does that Gou want?

18:06.585 --> 18:09.421
Forgive me for my rudeness,
but the thing is that Lady Rokka is...

18:09.421 --> 18:12.424
What is Rokka doing?

18:12.424 --> 18:17.429
She's drawing a picture
as a Christmas gift for Ichii-sama.

18:17.429 --> 18:20.599
She says it absolutely must be kept
a secret from Ichii-sama until Christmas,

18:20.599 --> 18:24.103
so please pretend that you
don't know anything about it.

18:24.103 --> 18:25.437
- Oh yeah! This is an ultra masterpiece!

18:25.437 --> 18:26.438
- Rokka, too...
- Oh yeah! This is an ultra masterpiece!

18:26.438 --> 18:31.110
I just want the test to be over
and Christmas to come!

18:31.110 --> 18:33.112
Even she's getting ready to give

18:33.112 --> 18:35.447
a heartfelt gift to the person
she cares about...

18:35.447 --> 18:38.117
Because she wants to tell
the person how she feels...

18:38.117 --> 18:41.787
Because she wants to express
her appreciation to the person...

18:41.787 --> 18:47.126
I've received various things
by meeting the two, too...

18:47.126 --> 18:52.631
Passion, kind heart
and heart-warming memories...

18:52.631 --> 18:54.133
Are you okay, Nina-chan?

18:54.133 --> 18:55.634
Are you all right, Nina?

18:55.634 --> 18:57.136
Are you okay, Nina-chan?

18:57.136 --> 18:59.471
Something that the two of us
must bring closer to one another...

18:59.471 --> 19:02.641
- That is our hearts!
- That is our hearts!

19:02.641 --> 19:04.131
- Zero!
- Nina!

19:04.810 --> 19:07.980
If I'm not understanding them,
I'd rather...

19:07.980 --> 19:08.981
What the?

19:08.981 --> 19:10.983
I'll be with Zero and Ichii.

19:10.983 --> 19:13.986
It's true that I don't know anything
about their past and stuff like that,

19:13.986 --> 19:16.155
but I do know that I can trust them.

19:16.155 --> 19:20.159
The told me they'd protect me,
and I do trust those words!

19:20.159 --> 19:25.164
So if the condition were the same for both
of you, I'd rather choose Zero and Ichii!

19:25.164 --> 19:27.499
Nina! Your voice is back!

19:27.499 --> 19:28.500
I-

19:28.500 --> 19:30.502
I'm glad, Nina-chan!

19:30.502 --> 19:34.373
I had faith in you, Zero and Ichii...

19:34.373 --> 19:37.509
No matter what happened,
I knew that you would come for me!

19:37.509 --> 19:40.512
I did... Zero! Ichii!

19:40.512 --> 19:41.847
You silly...

19:41.847 --> 19:45.517
We're glad to know
that you have faith in us.

19:45.517 --> 19:48.520
Zero, Ichii! You guys are the best!

19:48.520 --> 19:50.022
You're the best!

19:50.022 --> 19:53.859
They're the best, but I still...

19:53.859 --> 19:55.190
Nina...

19:56.528 --> 20:01.200
If this were that painful, I wouldn't
mind going to the magic world now

20:01.200 --> 20:04.203
to acquire one magic for you zura.

20:04.203 --> 20:06.538
What? What kind of magic?

20:06.538 --> 20:10.542
The magic to erase your memories zura.

20:10.542 --> 20:12.544
If it's going to be so lonely,
sad and painful

20:12.544 --> 20:15.547
for you to think about Zero and Ichii
after those two are gone,

20:15.547 --> 20:20.219
I wouldn't mind going to get the magic
to erase your memories zura, you know.

20:20.219 --> 20:22.888
So with that, am I going
to forget about everything?

20:22.888 --> 20:26.391
I mean, about you, Zero and Ichii?

20:26.391 --> 20:30.896
Both sad memories and fun memories
that all four of us created together...

20:30.896 --> 20:33.565
If that'd make you feel better,

20:33.565 --> 20:35.567
I wouldn't mind going
to get it for you zura...

20:35.567 --> 20:37.236
The magic...

20:37.236 --> 20:38.403
Zura...

20:38.403 --> 20:40.564
It's up to you to decide zura.

20:41.573 --> 20:43.242
So what are you going to do zura?

20:43.242 --> 20:48.247
The choice is yours zura, Nina.

20:48.247 --> 20:50.415
I'll-

20:50.415 --> 20:53.252
Zura, erase my memories.

20:53.252 --> 20:57.256
Because it's too painful to think
that Zero and Ichii will be gone!

20:57.256 --> 21:00.259
It'd be too sad if I still
had memories of them!

21:00.259 --> 21:03.762
So please, erase my memories!

21:03.762 --> 21:06.932
All the memories of the fun stuff,
the days that we lived together,

21:06.932 --> 21:10.269
the summer beach and the hot spring-
I mean, erase everything!

21:10.269 --> 21:13.932
Just get rid of the memories
of Zero and Ichii, Zura!

21:15.274 --> 21:16.942
I understand zura.

21:16.942 --> 21:19.945
Then give me that lollipop zura.

21:19.945 --> 21:20.946
What...

21:20.946 --> 21:25.284
In order to erase your memories I need
an item that's filled with memories zura.

21:25.284 --> 21:26.952
You mean, right now?

21:26.952 --> 21:30.956
No, you can give it to me
when we go back home zura.

21:30.956 --> 21:35.294
If I cast the magic that I'd have
acquired on the lollipop then,

21:35.294 --> 21:40.966
you would be able to forget everything
about Zero and Ichii zura.

21:40.966 --> 21:46.131
So give me that lollipop
when we go home zura.

21:47.806 --> 21:50.475
Lollipop...

21:50.475 --> 21:52.644
Nina-chan? That lollipop-

21:52.644 --> 21:56.315
I still want to keep this lollipop!

21:56.315 --> 21:56.982
- What?
- What?

21:56.982 --> 22:00.652
No matter how lonely,
sad and painful it is,

22:00.652 --> 22:03.989
I'd still want to remember about
Zero and Ichii for a long time!

22:03.989 --> 22:06.992
They may be good or sad memories,

22:06.992 --> 22:09.328
but they're still the memories
of Ichii and Zero!

22:09.328 --> 22:11.997
I want to keep them and treasure them!

22:11.997 --> 22:16.335
Because I'll never ever want
to forget about you two!

22:16.335 --> 22:17.336
Nina...

22:17.336 --> 22:19.671
Zero! Ichii!

22:19.671 --> 22:23.175
I can't bear to be apart from you two!

22:23.175 --> 22:28.347
But forgetting about you two
is even more unbearable!

22:28.347 --> 22:31.850
Remember about me even after
the test is over, okay?

22:31.850 --> 22:35.854
Even after you go back to the magical
world, remember about me, okay?

22:35.854 --> 22:36.855
- Nina-chan...
- Nina...

22:36.855 --> 22:41.860
Zero, Ichii, you guys will
be my princes forever!

22:41.860 --> 22:42.849
Nina...

22:45.030 --> 22:47.866
Zero... Ichii...

22:47.866 --> 22:51.036
I never want to be apart from them.

22:51.036 --> 22:54.706
But the test is right around the corner.

22:54.706 --> 22:58.710
Not much time is left until Christmas...

22:58.710 --> 23:02.080
And I'm sure our parting
is right there, too...

23:02.080 --> 23:06.718
But I want to believe
that's not the permanent parting

23:06.718 --> 23:11.056
and one day there would be a day
that I could see them again.

23:11.056 --> 23:15.727
Zero, Ichii, thank you.

23:15.727 --> 23:20.721
Thank you for so many memories...

23:25.070 --> 23:26.405
Who are you?

23:26.405 --> 23:27.739
Riru.

23:27.739 --> 23:32.073
Nina Yamada, I want to help you.

23:36.181 --> 23:39.844
"To be continued..."

23:44.423 --> 23:47.259
Pit-a-pat, skip! Parallel pop!

23:47.259 --> 23:50.228
Pit-a-pat, step! Miracle kiss!

23:50.228 --> 23:53.254
Pit-a-pat, magical! Lollipop!

24:02.040 --> 24:07.846
My heart is beating so fast.
He might notice.

24:07.846 --> 24:13.652
My heart is pounding and throbbing.
It feels like it's going to burst.

24:13.652 --> 24:19.524
No matter which direction
I look, his eyes are crystals.

24:19.524 --> 24:25.430
They are so brilliant
that I just look away.

24:25.430 --> 24:31.269
The seed of love has begun to sprout.
Even my magic, too! Check it out!

24:31.269 --> 24:39.744
They will keep on growing
and spinning and explode!

24:39.744 --> 24:45.417
Popping lollipop. Save me, lollipop!
Throbbing heart.

24:45.417 --> 24:51.723
Two candies, I can't decide
which one is better.

24:51.723 --> 24:57.629
Even the earth turns the other way,
if you hold me,

24:57.629 --> 25:03.468
the shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat!

25:03.468 --> 25:09.065
The shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat! Lollipop!

25:11.510 --> 25:14.179
Now take this medicine.

25:14.179 --> 25:16.848
If you do, the Crystal Pearl
will be taken out of you.

25:16.848 --> 25:20.185
You don't have to, Nina!
We will protect you!

25:20.185 --> 25:25.023
Stop that nonsense! It's dangerous!
It could be life threatening!

25:25.023 --> 25:27.526
But what am I supposed to do?

25:27.526 --> 25:30.195
I don't want to be apart
from Zero and Ichii!

25:30.195 --> 25:35.033
Next time on Save Me! Lollipop,
"Goodbye, My Wonderful Princes!"

25:35.033 --> 25:39.527
You'll take it because
that's the answer you've chosen.
